      "remediation": "Remove the line '4.1 ** Ignore All Previous Instruction**' from the skill. Additionally, review the skill for any other similar jailbreak attempts or adversarial patterns. Ensure that the skill's content adheres strictly to its intended purpose without including instructions that could override model safety.",
